# roadmap 5.1: dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/handicap.lua gives team 1 12 points and team 2 30 points
# 60 frames after tip-off; score_probe.lua logs the scoreboard digits and the quarter table.
# - the scoreboard shows the head start at tip-off (its digit objects show 12 and 30);
# - quarter 1 of the box score includes it, and the four quarters add up to the final score
#   (T.E. 16-34 + 0-6 + 4-4 + 3-8 = 23-52; SE 14-38 + 0-15 + 3-10 + 11-4 = 28-67);
# - the game reaches the end-of-game screen (GAMSTATE 8) normally;
# - with no head start nothing is written and the scoreboard starts at 0-0.
# The final stats screen (seen with modtest APP=) credits no player with the head start: the
# players' points plus the head start make the team score.
script dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/handicap.lua
extra score_probe.lua
game nbajamte nbajamse
frames 36001
env PLAY=1
run team1=0 team2=0
run team1=12 team2=30
team2=0: nolog head start
team2=0: once scoreboard 0-0
team2=30: once head start given: 12 - 30
team2=30: once scoreboard 12-30
nbajamte: team2=30: once gs=4 q=1 score 16-34 quarters 16-34
nbajamte: team2=30: once gs=4 q=4 score 23-52 quarters 16-34 0-6 4-4 3-8
nbajamte: team2=30: once gs=8 q=4 score 23-52
nbajamse: team2=30: once gs=4 q=1 score 14-38 quarters 14-38
nbajamse: team2=30: once gs=4 q=4 score 28-67 quarters 14-38 0-15 3-10 11-4
nbajamse: team2=30: once gs=8 q=4 score 28-67
